Files in this directory are sample files for unit testing of page tests.
Sample files can have multiple dependencies from unit tests, so changing a sample file requires an updates in any tests
that might be using them.

Aside from that, there are files with AI instructions used for generating most of these files.
AI instructions serve as a guideline. Results from those instructions were additionally adapted to fit certain samples,
so it is not possible to reconstruct samples using the AI instructions solely. Results need to be checked and adapted
additionally after AI generates them.
